<title>USA: CCC says seeks 11,120 tonnes of corn-soy blend.</title>
<headline>CCC says seeks 11,120 tonnes of corn-soy blend.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was seeking 11,120 tonnes of corn-soy blend for its export programs.</p>
<p>Offers should be submitted by November 14 for reply the following day. Shipment was slated for December 6-January 5.</p>
<p>The tender comprised 8,850 tonnes for India, 1,240 tonnes for Madagascar, 830 tonnes for Guatemala and 200 tonnes for Ghana.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
